{"channelId":"UClmtIIEnWi39WqZ8oj2PVRg","row":["MyHorseUniversity",9910,"My Horse University (MHU) was established in 2005 at Michigan State University, the pioneer land-grant university with nationally-ranked programs in equine science and management. MHU brings research and knowledge from world-renowned equine experts to online courses and products.\r\n\r\nMHU's courses provide a comprehensive and convenient learning experience for horse enthusiasts throughout the world.  MHU provides premier learning experiences in an online format thats flexible in order to meet your needs. Additionally, we offer science-based research and information in all of our courses and products.\r\n\r\nJoin us today and take a course!\r\n\r\n- Horse Nutrition *NEW!\r\n- Horse Behavior & Welfare\r\n- Horse Selection & Evaluation\r\n- Trail Riding 101 *NEW!\r\n- Horse Breeding & Selection Series\r\n- Breeding for a Champion\r\n\r\nand so much more!","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClmtIIEnWi39WqZ8oj2PVRg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClmtIIEnWi39WqZ8oj2PVRg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:44.867Z","channelId":"UClmtIIEnWi39WqZ8oj2PVRg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e909407298e87d297bf5ed318df64f4c3929ea011961b686d855eb82aad327eb","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"2eefcf09954266fc670972a21c99255d8fa71e38c0db22ae89da8b2fcbe70e26"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClmtIIEnWi39WqZ8oj2PVRg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":9910,"raw":"9.91K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClmtIIEnWi39WqZ8oj2PVRg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:44.867Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]},{"keyword":"veterinarian",